# Scratch screenshots land at the repo root; images we actually ship live in
# docs/images/, assets-source/ and winui/Assets/, so nothing real is caught here.
/*.png
# "nul" is a reserved device name: a mistyped redirect on Windows creates a file
# by that name instead of discarding the output.
nul

# Local agent/tooling state (kept out of the repo, not just the global ignore)
.claude/
AGENTS.local.md
*.local.md
HANDOFF.md
handoff*.md
*HANDOFF*

# Editor state
.vscode/
.idea/
